        tabLabel: 'About',
        pages: [
          {
            title: 'Mariaccio',
            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Mariaccio is a spirited Italian card game from the Neapolitan tradition, specifically a variation of Briscola. It is also known as 'Marianna' or 'Mariaggia' (when played with open cards). The defining feature is the 'Marriage' (Mariaccio)â€”a King and Knight of the same suitâ€”which grants bonus points. It is a game of high targets, usually requiring 250 points to win, making it a longer and more tactical experience than standard Briscola.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Derived from the merging of Briscola mechanics with the 'Marriage' (King-Queen) bonuses of the Mariagespiel family.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Two players. Five cards are dealt to each player; the eleventh card is placed face up on the table to determine the trump suit. The remaining stock is placed face down across the face-up trump. The non-dealer leads to the first trick.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '40 cards. Ranking: Ace, 3, King, Knight, Jack, 7, 6, 5, 4, 2.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '40 cards. Ranking: Ace, 3, King, Knight, Jack, 7, 6, 5, 4, 2.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Each player receives 5 cards. A trump card is turned up to set the 'Briscola' suit.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Variations',
            subtitle: 'Known ways this game changes',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'list',
                style: 'unordered',
                items: [
                  {
                    text: 'Mariaggia: Played with open cards (hands visible); same rules and 250-point target.',
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
